iant on domestic  domestic innovation that a  few of the future in the longer term  looks much bleaker leaker for russia and  for ukraine in this sense  well nick at least ukrainians will be  able to take some hope from that  that's all for our business special  looking at ukraine and russia's  respective economies as the conflict  slips into its seventh month many thanks  to my guests nick connolly and lara  solanco if you've enjoyed this video  remember to hit like and subscribe and  why not check out some of our other  stuff on our dw news channel on youtube  from me and the team goodbye and we hope  to see you again soon

